  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for CARIFORUM role in regional cooperation and EPA Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on four areas: 1) Strengthening Intra-CARIFORUM Cooperation 2) Increasing Inter-CARIFORUM cooperation 3) Reinforcing EU-CARIFORUM, 4) Ensure monitoring and coordination over the 11th EDF Caribbean Regional Indicative Programme; 5) Supporting CARIFORUM capacity to implement and monitor the EU-CARIFORUM Economic Partnership Agreement (EPA).</narrative>
  </description>
